<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">a
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Verified Certifications & Skill Credentials</title>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;600;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

    <style>
        :root {
            --bg-dark: #294F6D;
            --surface: #FAF9F6;
            --accent-blue: #3D6F91;
            --accent-brown: #674C3B;
            --brown-dark: #49352A;
            --cream-light: #F4F3EF;
            --text-main: #49352A;
            --text-dim: #817467;
            --border: #D9D9D2;
        }

        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
            font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
        }

        body {
            background: var(--bg-dark);
            color: var(--text-main);
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        header {
            padding: 60px 10%;
            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(250,249,246,0.2);
            text-align: center;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #294F6D, #3D6F91);
        }

        header h1 {
            font-size: 2.5rem;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            color: #FAF9F6;
        }

        header p {
            color: #E9EDF0;
            font-size: 1rem;
        }

        .dashboard-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(400px, 1fr));
            gap: 24px;
            padding: 40px 10%;
            max-width: 1400px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        .card {
            background: var(--surface);
            border-radius: 16px;
            padding: 32px;
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(15, 35, 50, 0.15);
        }

        .card h3 {
            color: var(--accent-blue);
            margin-bottom: 16px;
        }

        .lesson-box {
            background: #F4F3EF;
            padding: 15px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            border: 1px solid #D9D9D2;
        }

        .lesson-box h5 {
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            color: var(--accent-brown);
            text-transform: uppercase;
            margin-bottom: 5px;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
        }

        .lesson-box p {
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            color: var(--brown-dark);
        }

        .strategy {
            background: #E9EDF0;
            padding: 16px;
            border-left: 4px solid var(--accent-blue);
            border-radius: 4px;
            color: var(--brown-dark);
        }

        .strategy h5 {
            color: var(--accent-brown);
            margin-bottom: 6px;
        }

        .strategy strong {
            color: #294F6D;
        }

        /* Responsive design */
        @media (max-width: 600px) {
            header {
                padding: 40px 6%;
            }

            header h1 {
                font-size: 1.8rem;
            }

            .dashboard-grid {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
                padding: 24px 5%;
            }

            .card {
                padding: 24px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

<header>
    <h1>Verified Certifications & Skill Credentials</h1>
    <p>Expanded framework for total technical and cognitive excellence.</p>
</header>

<div class="dashboard-grid">

    <!-- ANALYTICS -->
    <div class="card">
        <h3>Digital Analytics & Data Ops</h3>
        <div class="lesson-box">
            <h5>Core Concept</h5>
            <p>Mastering the telemetry of the internet to identify revenue leakage.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="strategy">
            <h5>Synthesis Lesson</h5>
            <p><strong>GA4/SQL Synergy:</strong> Extract data to build custom attribution models that standard dashboards ignore.</p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- INFRASTRUCTURE -->
    <div class="card">
        <h3>Cloud Systems & Architecture</h3>
        <div class="lesson-box">
            <h5>Core Concept</h5>
            <p>Designing systems using programmable services.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="strategy">
            <h5>Synthesis Lesson</h5>
            <p><strong>IaC Mastery:</strong> Use Terraform to define infrastructure. It controls your stack, ensuring everything is reproducible.</p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- COMMUNICATION -->
    <div class="card">
        <h3>Strategic Communication</h3>
        <div class="lesson-box">
            <h5>Core Concept</h5>
            <p>Skills are useless if they cannot be translated into financial outcomes for stakeholders.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="strategy">
            <h5>Synthesis Lesson</h5>
            <p><strong>The "So What" Framework:</strong> Before presenting data, identify the financial risk or opportunity. Explain "lost revenue" to align with management incentives.</p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- PERSONAL SYSTEMS -->
    <div class="card">
        <h3>High-Velocity Personal Systems</h3>
        <div class="lesson-box">
            <h5>Core Concept</h5>
            <p>Architecting your output to separate labor from time through automation and deep work.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="strategy">
            <h5>Synthesis Lesson</h5>
            <p><strong>Contextual Batching:</strong> Group tasks (coding, writing) in 90-minute blocks.</p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- CYBERSECURITY -->
    <div class="card">
        <h3>Security & Compliance</h3>
        <div class="strategy">
            <h5>Synthesis Lesson</h5>
            <p><strong>Compliance as Leverage:</strong> Use frameworks to create a legal moat around your technical processes.</p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- REVENUE OPS -->
    <div class="card">
        <h3>Revenue Operations (RevOps)</h3>
        <div class="lesson-box">
            <h5>Core Concept</h5>
            <p>Integrating sales, marketing, and success into one automated engine.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="strategy">
            <h5>Synthesis Lesson</h5>
            <p><strong>Data Handshakes:</strong> Configure workflows to enrich lead data automatically, ensuring the highest value leads reach sales instantly.</p>
        </div>
    </div>

</div>

</body>
</html>
